  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MECS Follow up study in Mangaltar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this current assignment is to expand our research to explore the use of multiple devices in a household, particularly as mechanisms for mitigating the upfront costs are emerging (e.g. cost reduction of devices, credit facilities, utilities led financing, carbon finance, and results based financing). We seek to generate data on a wider range of devices and how they can be used to meet all household cooking needs.</narrative>
  </description>
